<title>BELARUS: Belarus Jan producer prices rise 16.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Belarus Jan producer prices rise 16.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belarus producer prices rose 16.8 percent in January compared to a 6.1 percent rise in December, the Statistics Ministry said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    BELARUS PRODUCER PRICES(%)   Jan 97    Dec 96   Jan 96</p>
<p>     mth/mth			    +16.8     +6.1	+4.7</p>
<p>     yr/yr				+47.5    +32.6     +74.2</p>
<p>January consumer price inflation was 13.3 percent against 7.4 percent in December.</p>
<p>--Kiev Newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
